{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an increasingly oppressive world, a magpie feeds her only remaining child amidst a city of lackluster sightseers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take their vision and feed your son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MAGEYE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/5a0d5ad6cbccf896acd4e1c530ab5dfb.gif?t=1772253790\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/5a0d5ad6cbccf896acd4e1c530ab5dfb.poster.avif?t=1772253790\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a tragedy and being forced to tend to the infected wounds of your only remaining kin, you remain confined to a city and reap the vision of uselessly sighted wanderers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.poster.avif?t=1772253790\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.webm?t=1772253790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.mp4?t=1772253790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly, dive, and tear out eyeballs from those who condemned and failed you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your beautiful son, before it hurts too much to breathe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch  loud, messy visual novel sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh at their lawlessness as new enemies come into view.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with objects, uncover scenarios, and understand less than before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppress yourself, as emotion is always weakness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cry anyway, because it hurts so much to see love die before you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.poster.avif?t=1772253790\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.webm?t=1772253790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.mp4?t=1772253790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3-4 hours worth of psychological terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vengeful flight maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palatable eye-stealing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white pixelated visuals with a modernized, bleeding retro aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotionally charged, messy drawings and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable level progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excessive amounts of corpses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, edgy humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential dread.</p